        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this superb three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached family home to the market, ideally situated in the highly sought-after Hazelbury Green development, Clonee, Dublin 15.\nHazelbury Green enjoys an excellent location, with Clonee Village within walking distance and Blanchardstown Shopping Centre within minutes. The area is well served by a wide range of local amenities, including shops, cafés, recreational facilities and an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools, making this an ideal location for families. The property also benefits from easy access to the N3 and M50 motorway networks, providing convenient links to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and surrounding areas.\nBright and well-proportioned internal accommodation extending to approximately c. 97 sq.m briefly comprises entrance hallway, living room, kitchen/dining area, three well-appointed bedrooms and three bathrooms.\nExternally, No. 71 benefits from a generous driveway providing ample off-street parking together with a LARGE sunny rear garden, offering excellent private outdoor space for families and entertaining.\nThe property is presented in good condition and comes to the market with no onward chain, making it an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families and those looking to trade up. The property also benefits from gas fired central heating.\nGiven the excellent location, generous accommodation and fantastic outdoor space, we expect this property to be extremely popular.\nEarly viewing is strongly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to register your interest and arrange a viewing.\n\nFeatures:\n• 3 Bed / 3 Bath Semi-Detached\n• C. 97 sq.m\n• BER C Rated\n• No onward chain\n• LARGE sunny rear garden\n• Generous driveway\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Highly sought-after development\n• Walking distance to Clonee Village\n• Within minutes of Blanchardstown Shopping Centre\n• Excellent primary & secondary school catchment\n• Easy access to N3 & M50\n• Convenient access to Dublin City Centre & Dublin Airport\n• Ideal family home\n• Ideal for first-time buyers and those looking to trade up\n• Early viewing strongly advised"
      },
      {
